              []
          - mLabel: Base Texture
            mType: Define
            mName: ENABLE_BASE_TEX
            mWidget: group_start
            mHint: |-
              Define: ENABLE_BASE_TEX
              
              Most materials use a base texture (albedo), but disabling it means the base texture will be considered white, and 'Base Color' will solely control the color.
